{"series":{"id":"honor-de-reyes","slug":"honor-de-reyes","title":"Honor De Reyes","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/honor-de-reyes-2__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"En el vasto continente, los héroes superan obstáculos y persiguen sus sueños. ¿Cómo son los héroes? Van más allá de sí mismos e intentan ser perfectos; llevan cargas adelante y comprenden el verdadero significado del amor; abogan por el poder y nunca se rinden. Escribimos biografías de héroes y empezamos un nuevo capítulo de amor y coraje.Basado en el juego Honor of Kings, la serie sigue la historia de varios héroes del juego mientras luchan por proteger su reino y cumplir sus sueños.","genres":["Acción"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/honor-de-reyes","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:28.706Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"honor-de-reyes-1","slug":"honor-de-reyes-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/honor-de-reyes-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"honor-de-reyes","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/honor-de-reyes-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:33.725Z","episodeCount":4,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":4,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true},{"id":"honor-de-reyes-2","slug":"honor-de-reyes-2","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/honor-de-reyes-2-1","image":null,"number":2,"seriesId":"honor-de-reyes","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/honor-de-reyes-2-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:31.667Z","episodeCount":4,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":4,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"honor-de-reyes-1-1","slug":"honor-de-reyes-1-1","title":"Honor De Reyes — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/honor-de-reyes-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/honor-de-reyes-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:35:32.186Z","seriesId":"honor-de-reyes","seasonId":"honor-de-reyes-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":